            "answer": "<p>No — and that’s deliberate. There’s no caffeine and no stimulant in GOMU, so there’s no rush and nothing to come down from afterwards. What it does is cover the daily intake your metabolism draws on. If what you want is a jolt in 20 minutes, this isn’t the product.</p>"
